      "content": "4.1 Overview"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "Telangana's economy relies significantly on agricultural productivity, supported by major irrigation projects and tank restoration.",
        "Mission Kakatiya focuses on reviving minor irrigation tanks, while Mission Bhagiratha aims to ensure safe drinking water supply.",
        "The state is a leading global hub for IT services, biotechnology, and pharmaceutical industries centered in and around Hyderabad.",
        "Comprehensive welfare schemes play a vital role in inclusive growth and socio-economic development across the state."
      ],
