    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "vprdfjr",
      "content": "Telangana is one of the fastest-growing states in India. Since its formation in 2014, the state has made remarkable strides in infrastructure, IT industry, agriculture, and social welfare. Hyderabad has emerged as a global hub for information technology, pharmaceuticals, and biotechnology."
