    {
      "id": "dswftmc",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "4.2.2 Irrigation Projects"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "z51pm9o",
      "content": "Telangana has one of the most ambitious irrigation development programs in India. Key projects include:"
    },
    {
      "type": "pullQuote",
      "content": "Mission Kakatiya and Mission Bhagiratha",
      "id": "qqycx2s"
    },
    {
      "id": "cew21zw",
      "type": "table",
      "rows": [
        {
          "isHeader": true,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>Project</strong></p>",
            "<p><strong>River</strong></p>",
            "<p><strong>Significance</strong></p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Kaleshwaram Lift Irrigation Scheme (KLIS)</p>",
            "<p>Godavari</p>",
            "<p>World's largest multi-stage lift irrigation project; lifts water to Deccan Plateau</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Nagarjuna Sagar Dam</p>",
            "<p>Krishna</p>",
            "<p>One of the largest masonry dams in the world; serves both TS and AP</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Srisailam Dam</p>",
            "<p>Krishna</p>",
            "<p>Second largest capacity reservoir in India; hydropower and irrigation</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Pochampad Dam (Sriram Sagar)</p>",
            "<p>Godavari</p>",
            "<p>Oldest major irrigation project in Telangana</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
