    {
      "id": "66vaonw",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 3,
      "content": "4.2.3 Mission Kakatiya and Mission Bhagiratha"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "twun6tx",
      "content": "Mission Kakatiya: Launched in 2015, this scheme aimed to restore and revive the traditional tank irrigation system of Telangana. Thousands of tanks were desilted and repaired, increasing water storage capacity and supporting farmers."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "5eigwdj",
      "content": "Mission Bhagiratha: A flagship scheme to provide clean drinking water to every household in Telangana. It aimed to cover 24,000 villages and 67 urban local bodies with piped drinking water from surface water sources (Godavari and Krishna rivers)."
    },
    {
